COMMIT NOTES
- The SSCSensor "sample-rate" GObject property was READABLE; the erhai patch
  makes it READWRITE so a client can request a rate before opening the sensor
  (libssc-sensor.c), and ssccli exposes it as `-r, --rate HZ` (libssc-cli.c).
- Measured behaviour on erhai (2026-09-13): the SSC hardware floors the rate
  at 5 Hz (a 1 Hz request delivers 5 Hz) and a concurrent compass claim pushes
  the magnetometer back up to ~50 Hz regardless of the request.
- Build: meson build dir `build-erhai`; `ninja -C build-erhai` produces
  src/ssccli and src/libssc.so.2 which are copied into this package.